WEBVTT

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:30.463
It leaves you in a tough spot,

00:02:30.497 --> 00:02:32.497
and it's unfair.

00:02:33.063 --> 00:02:37.097
So I'm thinking of things
like survivor guilt,

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.397
or people who are in the position

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:44.997
where they think they're responsible
for a loved one's addiction,

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:46.330
for example.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.397
No, that's not your responsibility,

00:02:48.397 --> 00:02:50.797
and not to feel guilt about that,

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.763
and to really check,
"Is this my responsibility?"

00:02:53.797 --> 00:02:55.363
Then I think in those cases,

00:02:55.363 --> 00:02:57.630
we have to kind of double-check and say,

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.697
"Really, am I responsible? Is this fair?